  "content": "<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/T0pSeQj.png\" alt=\"Ottercraft Banner\"><strong>1.1.10 之前的 Fabric 和 Forge 版本需要：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" rel=\"nofollow\">Geckolib</a></strong><strong>Fabric 版本需要：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\">Fabric API</a></strong><h1>功能列表</h1><ul>\n<li>水獺會在河流和沼澤生態域中生成。</li>\n<li>牠們是半水生動物，喜歡在陸地和水中玩耍。</li>\n<li>牠們天生好奇，會跟隨附近的船隻或游泳的玩家。</li>\n<li>牠們可以用鱈魚或鮭魚馴服和繁殖。</li>\n<li>馴服後的水獺會穿上救生衣，並在你的 Minecraft 冒險中跟隨你。</li>\n<li>救生衣可以染成不同顏色。</li>\n<li>牠們喜歡和你一起坐在船上！</li>\n</ul><h1>計劃中的功能</h1><ul>\n<li>從河岸滑下和在雪地中玩耍</li>\n<li>巨型水獺，可在陸地和水上騎乘</li>\n<li>更多水獺變種</li>\n<li>多樣化的水獺紋理</li>\n</ul><img src=\"http://web.archive.org/web/20211216124059/https://thumbs.gfycat.com/SecretBaggyFlies.webp\" alt=\"Otter Running\"><em>歡迎將此模組加入任何模組包，只需標註我們即可！</em><h1>遊戲截圖：</h1><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/BywqtNh.png\" alt=\"otter_running\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/roW02LZ.png\" alt=\"otter_lilypad\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Fjxeu7s.png\" alt=\"otter_swimming\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SUCfeSU.png\" alt=\"otters_in_boat\"><h1><strong>模組評測！（點擊影片可跳轉觀看！）</strong></h1><h3><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/Angelbeee\" rel=\"nofollow\">Angelbee</a></h3><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fyoutu.be%252fI7qIVZuXhic\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/I7qIVZuXhic/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"Angelbee\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fyoutu.be%252fpinhxXE3CEM\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/pinhxXE3CEM/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"Angelbee\"></a><h3><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/PwrDown\" rel=\"nofollow\">PwrDown</a></h3><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fyoutu.be%252fi9Sjkxtu9DM\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/i9Sjkxtu9DM/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"Pwrdown\"></a><h3><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/c/yorkmousemodz\" rel=\"nofollow\">YorkmouseModz</a></h3><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fyoutu.be%252fT3YSgakWoxA\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/T3YSgakWoxA/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"YorkmouseModz\"></a><h3><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCfdj7bbnoCAkcPJ5ryr7aDQ\" rel=\"nofollow\">Nala's Planet</a></h3><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fyoutu.be%252fSYM-r4S03Js\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/SYM-r4S03Js/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"NalasPlanet\"></a><h3><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@bluecrusader\" rel=\"nofollow\">thebluecrusader</a></h3><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fyoutu.be%252ffTEdS1QyYBM\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/fTEdS1QyYBM/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"thebluecrusader\"></a>",
